# The upstream pixel-art reference, fetched for study only. It is a third-party
# project (W17ANT/Claude-Office, MIT) whose art the office teardown concluded must
# not be vendored, and at 313 MB it would dominate the repo. The rebuilt office is
# office/ and shares no code with it.
claude-office/

# Multi-agent pipeline scratch state (see .commandcode/AGENTS.md). Holds the live
# task.json, history.jsonl and artifacts/ for the current run — working files, not
# deliverable source.
.agent/

# The Office dashboard. Local-only tooling: it reads this machine's pi session
# store and its roster, so it is deliberately kept out of version control. Left on
# disk, untracked. It was committed once and has since been removed from the index;
# the files themselves were never deleted. This also covers office/.runtime/, whose
# hook spool holds real command text and file paths from local sessions.
office/

# graphify knowledge-graph output — generated artifact, local only
graphify-out/

# Local working backups (e.g. timesheet_app.local-backup.html)
*.local-backup.*

# =========================
# Confidential source data — local only, never commit
# =========================
# Real customer invoice-audit workbooks (Soll-Ist-Vergleich). Used locally to
# validate the Anmerkung engine; must stay out of the repo.
*Soll-Ist*.xls*
data/*Soll-Ist*

# Operation Report source data (named-staff person-days). The seed is baked
# into assets/report-data-seed.js; the raw workbook stays local only.
*REPORT DATA*.xls*
data/REPORT DATA*
data/

# Wackler tariff matrices — business data, local only. The public artifact is
# assets/wackler-ratecards.enc.json (built by scripts/encrypt-ratecards.mjs).
assets/wackler-ratecard.js
assets/wackler-national-ratecard.js

docs/*
!docs/anmerkung/
firestore.rules
